ful \"Italian girls\" now avaialable from USA!!\nSHIPPING FREE! For a limited time\nwww.ANOTHERWORLDDESIGNS.com'),(188,5559,'2000-03-06 23:40:20',4854,0,'blaster','The Little Green Man\'s gun is NOW availible as a stand alone kit!!! The gun come in two parts and will reatil for $30.00 Please email me for details.'),(190,4863,'2000-03-17 12:08:54',4955,0,'barbara1','A new Erotic Dream from JJ Models Italian Art! BARBARA: Sexy Series Vol 11 Limited and Numbered Editions 1.000 pcs only! Including Warranty,Card to collect and comics introdutions\nPre-Order Your copy by E-mail and get 10% OFF!\nwww.JJMODELS.com and for US residents www.ANOTHERWORLDDESIGNS.com'),(191,4931,'2000-08-05 19:47:59',5052,0,'chang','G-Force proudly announces General Chang, from Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country.<BR><BR>\n\nAn amazing likeness to Christopher Plummer!<BR><BR>\n\n- Bust: 4\", Base: 2\"<BR> \n- Sculpted by: Anthony Veilleux<BR>\n- Parts: 3 (2 resin, 1 brass)<BR><BR>\n\nPrice: $35.00 US + $5.00 shipping<BR><BR>\n\nFor more information, visit: <a href=\"http://www.gforcemodels.com/gforce/chang/chang.html\">www.gforcemodels.com</a>'),(192,18,'2000-05-05 08:46:07',5056,0,'arora','If you could ask one girl to go to the super-hero ball, cyborg reunion, an Egyptian dig, or to the mad monster party who would you ask?  <a href=\"http://www.gremlins.com/azimuth_design/arora.html\"><b>Arora</b></a> of course!  Mike James latest creation of a \"generic\" girl kit should put your imagination into overdrive!\n<p>\n<i>\"All dressed up and no where to go.\"</i>  That phrase just doesn\'t apply to Arora...\n</p>'),(193,5338,'2000-05-12 01:46:36',5057,0,'WEBnew','Shapeshifters announce the release of \'Christopher Lee\' as \'Dracula\'. The fifth release in the \'Hammers Horror\'s\'.\nThis is 1/3rd scale bust, standing at 9.5inches tall. It is available direct from Shapeshifters. Please contact us for further information. To see more work from Shapeshifters please visit our web-site our view the Gremlins gallery.'),(195,233,'2000-05-14 21:19:10',4974,0,'kai','Kaiju is a BIG kit limited to 500 castings.  Sculpted by Tony Spangler and cast by Mark Brokaw, this kit is sure to be a hit among Japanese monster fans!  Visit Artistic License Productions\' home page to order yours!'),(196,5559,'2000-09-24 17:39:18',5063,0,'pickledpunk','The Pickled Punk is our third model kit.. This 1/2 scale resin model comes molded in translucent skin like resin and includes his very own storage/display container. Gross out your friends with these oddities!!! Over 6 inches long!!!\nThis little guy will make his first showing at this years Wonderfest... You can take him home for only $60.00 plus shipping and this includes his very own storage container! Own him today!!! '),(199,4931,'2000-08-05 19:46:14',5066,0,'mangalore','G-Force announces its newest kit: Mangalore, from The Fifth Element. <BR><BR>\n\nThis is truly a great piece, it\'s face is full of character and the textures and detailing are sharp.<BR><BR>\n\nSculpted by Bob Dufour, this 6\" resin bust (plus 3\" earth element stone base!) is available now for $50.00 + $5.00 shipping.<BR><BR>\n\nFor more information and detailed photos, visit:\n<a href=\"http://www.gforcemodels.com/gforce/mangalore/index.html\">gforcemodels.com</a>\n'),(200,4863,'2000-08-29 12:29:35',5080,0,'EVIL1','New era Art Series Vol.2 The essence of the Evil!\nStraordinary JJM Kit with pure resin, clear resin and metal parts!!\n\nYou can see more details of this Arttistic model on www.jjmodels.com or www.anotherworlddesigns.com'),(204,5889,'2001-07-17 15:14:31',5132,0,'reaper','1/6 scale model kit cleanly cast in 100% bubble free resin and white metal with base. For more information visit us at our website at http://anjara design.tripod.com or e-mail: anjaradesign@btinternet.com'),(205,5889,'2001-07-17 15:16:17',5130,0,'maul','1/6 scale model kit cleanly cast in 100%\r\nbubble free resin and white metal. For\r\nmore information visit us at our website\r\nat: http://anjaradesign.tripod.com or e-mail: anjaradesign@btinternet.com'),(208,5559,'2000-09-14 00:13:15',5133,0,'voodoobuddy','Voodoo Buddy is.. well not exactly a resin kit... but he still is loads of fun for the whole family! He comes complete with one Voodoo Buddy doll full box art, directions, three cursed stick pins, three mojo bones and binding twin... All pack in spanish moss to keep him safe until arrivial. For more infor and where to get your very own Voodoo Buddy contact Pinkerton FX. Voodoo Buddy retails for only $20.00 plus shipping!\n'),(212,5964,'2000-09-13 08:51:33',5123,0,'clin','Please see our\n<a href=\"http://www.tcn.zaq.ne.jp/akahd205/\">Web</a>.\n\nThe closest likeness to Dirty Harry (Clint Eastwood) \nthat you can get in any Model Kit in the world.\nSculpted by Jun Ozawa (B.O.S).\nPainted by Masataka Yoshio (Kaibutsuya).'),(216,4863,'2001-01-06 11:51:42',5145,0,'shadriel1','The New JJ Models Fantasy Series Kit!!\r\nShadreil The Sorceress!\r\nHigh Quality Resin kit with clear resin and metal parts included. \r\nLimited Editions Order your copy By E-mail Today!!www.JJMODELS.com or www.AnotherWorldDesigns.com (for US resident only)'),(217,4863,'2001-01-11 11:33:33',5206,0,'veronica1','A new Dangerous dream from JJ Models,\r\nVeronica,high quality resin kit, clear resin shoes! Limited Editions 1000pcs.\r\nOrder your copy! www.jjmodels.com and for US resident: www.anotherworlddesigns.com \r\n(censored edition)'),(218,5559,'2001-02-06 02:30:50',5212,0,'punkenstein1','Ok guys and gals!!! Punkenstein will have his debut at the spring Chiller Show but for those of you who cant wait I am taking pre-orders now for this little bugger!!! The sale will last till the end of February at witch time Punkenstein will return to his normal retail price! The kit will include one Punkenstein (unpainted) cast in off white resin, chains, storage container, and his very own bundle of daises… The pre-order price for all this will be $45.00 plus $5.00 shipping and handling. Pre-ordered kits will start shipping by the middle of next month so do not delay! In progress photos ...Email me for further details!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nJohn Pinkerton \r\nPinkerton FX \r\n  \r\n'),(219,5559,'2001-02-06 02:47:34',5213,0,'bonecollector','No not the recent movie... But a new model my company has released! Somewhere between ape and man the Bone Collector is the missing link. Inspired by 2001 A Space Odessey... Frank Frazeta and my own imagination... I hope you like this one! Let me know what you think.. Bone Collector sells for $99.00 plus $8.00 shipping and handleing... Email me for all the details!'),(220,5559,'2001-02-06 02:59:11',5213,0,'boney','base detail'),(221,6128,'2001-07-17 17:29:19',5238,0,'cycl','This accurate version of this classic beast depicts the lumbersome giant finding something \"familiar\" washed ashore.  Comes with highly detailed beach-scape base.  $69.00 plus $6.00 s/h'),(222,6128,'2001-07-17 17:29:06',5240,0,'cent','This highly accurate, dramatic death struggle comes with shattered-stone base.  15 inches to top of hand.  $78.00 plus $6.00 s/h'),(223,6128,'2001-07-17 17:28:50',5239,0,'trog','This quality kit depicts the troglodyte in a fight for his life, as the wounds of giant cat claws bleed freely.  Comes with shrine floor base.  $55.00 plus $6.00 s/h'),(224,5559,'2001-07-10 23:53:53',5212,0,'punkenstein3',''),(225,6114,'2001-07-11 04:40:59',5264,0,'greymatter',''),(226,6127,'2001-07-12 21:21:39',5261,0,'clint','1/6 scale resin kit with base Clint Eastwood with gun drawn. This kit ships right away for a price of 55.00 + shipping.'),(227,6230,'2001-07-24 19:42:24',5280,0,'hunter1',''),(228,6230,'2001-07-24 19:40:50',5280,0,'hunter1',''),(229,4863,'2001-07-31 08:32:20',5281,0,'valerie1',''),(230,6127,'2001-08-04 21:24:44',5304,0,'MAX','Comming in August from www.resin_image.com'),(231,4863,'2001-08-08 06:20:16',5306,0,'daminar1',''),(232,4863,'2001-08-08 06:22:29',5306,0,'Daminar1',''),(233,4863,'2001-08-08 06:23:08',5306,0,'Daminar1',''),(234,6127,'2001-10-30 20:25:55',5304,0,'MAXPICS','1/6 scale Mad Max resin kit, The likeness to Max is the best. All pressure cast parts excellent quality \r\nwww.resin-image.com or email brett@resin-image.com'),(235,6243,'2001-11-01 07:47:12',5315,0,'calface','CALIBOS: THE VILE PRINCE from Burroughs Model Works.'),(236,6252,'2001-11-24 00:05:18',5317,0,'sdzeram','Caricature intergalactic psychopath! \r\nDefinately not cute....... 5 pieces of resin standing 150mm tall when assembled £14.95 plus postage at cost.'),(237,6312,'2001-11-03 10:23:58',3476,0,'',''),(238,5201,'2001-11-07 13:28:35',4912,0,'',''),(239,6252,'2001-11-24 00:03:54',5326,0,'predbust','LIFESIZE PREDATOR BUST - 20 SEPERATE TEETH, 48 SEPERATE RUBBER DREADLOCKS, 7 RESIN GUN PARTS...... 2ft by 2ft by 18 inch of mental mayhem!!'),(240,5201,'2001-11-10 06:31:21',5327,0,'',''),(241,5201,'2001-11-16 06:02:12',5327,0,'superman.jpg','Our hero off to do battle with the forces of evil,  Kit price and all details on our web site'),(242,5201,'2001-11-12 15:29:31',5329,0,'blade.jpg','The unsual hero of the underworld walk among us'),(243,6252,'2001-11-25 02:12:04',5344,0,'frankenstone_icon','small scale, big on character!\r\nFrankenstone is our tribute to a classic horror icon....'),(244,6252,'2001-11-25 02:11:39',5345,0,'goldfinger','Gert Frobe in his memorable role as Bonds arch enemy..... comes with case of gold bars..... no real ones of course! '),(245,6252,'2001-11-25 02:16:10',5346,0,'lazenby','George Lazenby in the role of Bond, part of our growing range of Bond kits.'),(246,6252,'2001-11-27 04:48:28',5347,0,'vampire','Tribal vampire - a modern day blood sucker! 1:1 scale based on a life(?)cast.. comes with piercing jewellery and a base..... 22inches tall...\r\nUK399.95 USA contact us for a price - we ship worldwide!'),(247,6252,'2001-12-02 02:57:13',5349,0,'slip','Slipknot front man captured in 1:3 scale resin bust!\r\nComes with Pentagram topped base and 10 seperate wire dreadlocks......\r\nUK 24.95 - we ship worldwide, contact us for prices.......'),(248,6391,'2001-12-13 14:17:43',5352,0,'http://www.realalien.com','This 13.5\" polyresin sculpture is what is commonly called \"The Grey\". it is a fine quality item and comes packaged in a gloss black box and custom foam. Based on eyewitness accounts. It can be purchased at \r\nhttp://www.realalien.com'),(249,6391,'2001-12-13 14:12:37',5352,0,'http://www.realalien.com','This 13.5\" polyresin sculpture is what is commonly called \"The Grey\". it is a fine quality item and comes packaged in a gloss black box and custom foam. Based on eyewitness accounts.'),(250,6243,'2001-12-27 12:36:12',5356,0,'CentWaist','More than a mere kit, an entire diorama that emits a strange mood of erie tribal culture.  A stunning version of the Golden Voyage Centaur.  Unprecedented in likness and accuracy.'),(251,6243,'2001-12-27 12:36:35',5355,0,'Ancclose','Extremely accurate and dynamic version of the Troglodyte. '),(252,5569,'2001-12-29 10:51:34',3476,0,'',''),(253,5569,'2001-12-29 11:23:10',5357,0,'Wishmaster3','BudgiesKits announces The Wishmaster'),(254,6252,'2002-01-02 00:27:42',5326,0,'','the largest commercially available bust of the Predator 2 character currently on the market!'),(255,6387,'2002-01-15 10:36:36',3476,0,'','Rosaline 11\" figurine by Nexus Sculpture'),(256,6387,'2002-01-15 12:24:21',5372,0,'gremach','New 1/12th scale kit from Nexus Sculpture'),(257,6252,'2002-02-11 23:33:43',5380,0,'monkey','The nature of Monkey is irrepresable!\r\nNow you can grace your workbench with this 1:6 scale rendering of the TV classic hero........ UK 49.95 - We ship world wide!'),(258,5933,'2002-02-26 16:01:35',5381,0,'',''),(259,5619,'2002-03-03 20:37:09',5382,0,'Witch',''),(260,5619,'2002-03-03 20:44:45',5382,0,'Witch',''),(261,6243,'2002-03-05 14:47:33',5383,0,'Close_bite','Huge, highly detailed and accurate resin model of the 1976 KING KONG.'),(262,6252,'2002-05-04 01:13:15',5387,0,'','hop on over to http://www.gremlynz.com select your region and then \"new releases\" to see pictures of our stunning new kit from sculptor Dave Lewis....... large size Space Jockey in resin!!'),(263,6252,'2002-06-04 11:57:03',5388,0,'','Dave Lewis does it again - GORT from Day the Earth Stood Still - optional visor to allow for visor open or shut and base with scenes from the classic film!'),(264,6252,'2002-06-09 01:09:41',5389,0,'','Dave Lewis sculpts up another brilliant bust - Klatuu from The Day The Earth Stood Still!\r\n210mm tall - seperate head or helmeted head and scenic base.... hop on over to http://www.gremlynz.com for pictures and prices!'),(265,5403,'2002-09-05 16:55:04',5437,0,'ramses',''),(266,5350,'2002-09-07 11:36:41',5393,0,'Chained','1/8 scale, 5 1/2\"tall, 9 interlocking part resin kit.\r\nPlease visit my website for more Dream Master kits at www.angelfire.com/il2/dreammaster'),(267,6546,'2002-10-17 14:29:44',3476,0,'',''),(268,6252,'2003-02-06 23:32:49',5502,0,'','1:1 scale Freddy bust - visit our website for image as the uploader here still seems kaput!\r\nhttp://www.gremlynz.com'),(269,4864,'2003-03-26 13:00:46',5491,0,'',''),(270,5633,'2003-06-07 12:18:27',5545,0,'george','George Harrison in concert in 1964  \r\nthis kit is made in poliuretane resin and it comes accompanied by one  replica of their Gretsch electric guitar  \r\nthe kit doesn\'t include the strings of the guitar neither the conección cable'),(271,6252,'2003-08-22 10:02:10',5551,0,'','gremlyn lord on throne with concubine, pet toad and boxes of munchies! \r\nhop on over to http://www.gremlynz.com for more details'),(272,5201,'2003-11-04 07:54:51',5553,0,'','check out the Mooncrest web site for all the details'),(273,5633,'2004-05-13 15:13:44',5545,0,'',''),(274,5633,'2004-05-13 16:10:28',5576,0,'darthmaul','Fito\'s Model Kit proudly presents \"THE DISCIPLE\"\r\nIn Scale 1/6, Made in 8 poliurethane resin parts'),(275,5575,'2006-01-22 08:49:37',3965,0,'',''),(276,5575,'2006-01-24 04:32:51',3965,0,'dark',''),(2