sio/greenbeholder2_icon.gif alt=\"Green Beholder - 5th one produced\" align=middle></a>\r\n<A HREF=http://www.gremlins.com/garage/galleryView.jsp?buildupUid=3042><IMG SRC=http://www.gremlins.com/phillip_besio/mottled_icon.gif alt=\"Mottled Beholder - 6th one produced\" align=middle></a>\r\n<HR>More info write:<A HREF=mailto:trekist@hotmail.com>trekist@hotmail.com</a><BR>pics are being updated'),(2909,5411,'2002-09-05 08:59:40',5436,5411,'mamel',0,''),(2910,5403,'2002-09-05 16:57:29',5437,5998,'ramses',0,''),(2911,5403,'2002-09-05 16:54:26',5437,5998,'ramses',0,''),(2320,5621,'2000-08-04 13:12:20',4943,5621,'belldandy',0,'Check my webpage : \nhttp://animefigurekit.com/\nLike the way I paint?  I can paint model for you!!  look my webpage.'),(2321,5621,'2000-08-04 13:18:00',4944,5621,'shampoo',0,'Check my webpage : \nhttp://animefigurekit.com/\nLike the way I paint?  I can paint model for you!!  look my webpage.'),(2323,5575,'2001-01-03 11:20:40',4947,5775,'motokokusanakiv',0,NULL),(2324,5575,'2001-01-03 11:20:40',4947,5775,'motokokusanakia',0,NULL),(2347,5329,'2004-02-20 21:38:47',4941,5771,'bluebeholder',0,'<B>Based on the many eyed Beholder monster from <I>Advanced Dungeons and Dragons</i>. I created this out of various materials I had hanging around.\r\nThe core is a styrofoam ball while the covering is <I>Model Magic</i> by <I>Crayola</i> (neat stuff).  \r\nBase is made of many different materials and depict treasures collected for and by this creature. \r\nDrips of resin simulate drool and slime. Painted in acrylics with a dark wash. <BR>\r\nAbout 2\" across and the base is 5\"x5\".\r\nI plan on producing a small kit similar to this. <BR>\r\n<BR>My others: \r\n<A HREF=http://www.gremlins.com/garage/galleryView.jsp?buildupUid=2407> <IMG SRC=http://www.gremlins.com/phillip_besio/greenbeholder_icon.gif alt=\"Baby Green Beholder - 1st one produced\" align=middle></a>\r\n<A HREF=http://www.gremlins.com/garage/galleryView.jsp?buildupUid=2347><IMG SRC=http://www.gremlin