001-01-03 11:22:02','South Park (Kenny, Cartman, Stan, Kyle)',27,8,0,14,4867,129,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4437,5067,'1998-06-24 01:08:01','The Prisoner',12,6,3,5,4943,4793,'89.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,' It\'s an easy kit to build. The body is cast in one piece, and then the head and base. A minimal seam on the body, and not a single bubble, but there are visable brush strokes from when the sculpture was brushed down, otherwise a very clean casting. The head was a different story. Riddled with bubbles and a moderate seam up the side. The likeness wasn\'t as great as it looked in the ad, but pretty damn close. I tried as hard as I could to find a round wooden base I could stain and attach to the bottom of the supplied resin base, to make it look more finished, but everything I found was just not big enough and I don\'t have a router so I was stuck. But it was a gift for my dad, he loved it, so I guess that\'s all that matters. ','',''),(4438,5188,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Monkey King',27,8,0,4,5188,129,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4439,4848,'1998-06-26 13:54:42','Cedrick The Zombie',10,6,0,7,281,4848,'110.0000','10.0000',1,NULL,NULL,'The kit is 13\" tall\nand comes complete with certificate  of authenticity, metal name plate and\nassembly instructions.','',''),(4440,5078,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Godzilla 1962-Head Line Series',27,10,5,12,149,5193,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4441,5187,'1998-07-07 00:29:40','Cindy the Vampire',12,6,3,7,5191,5187,'65.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'This is the first kit to be produced by Screamin\' Lemur.','',''),(4442,4931,'1999-06-10 09:06:34','Sayer of the Law',27,6,1,5,169,5439,'35.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'6\" x 7\" licenced resin bust','',''),(4443,5132,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Diatryma',27,8,5,11,149,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4444,5132,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Cera',27,8,57,8,149,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4445,5198,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Desert Stormtr