253,5242,'100.0000','7.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'Available NOW as a 1/6 scale kit! Coming soon as a prepainted statue!!<p>\n\n  \"...A ripped stocking... Now those scum have gone too far...\"<p>\n   This beautiful bounty hunter has come to be known as the \"Ballistic Rose\", for her sense of fashion, and for the gigantic rifle she carries!! This kit depicts Rose\'s quandry-- a ripped stocking being the difference between a perfect \"hit\", and one that went a little wrong.<p>  \n    The kit includes a desert diorama base, gun with removable clip, optional sidearm, helmet and dress.  Cast to the highest degree of quality, with interlocking, well-planned part separations.  All parts have a smooth, well-defined finish.  You won\'t be disappointed with this kit!<p>\n    Original character design and sculpture copyright 1998 James Hakola.<p>\nCome visit us at <a href=http://www.mrdandy.com>MrDandy.com</a>! ','Girl,Sexy,Guns,Anime, sci-fi',''),(4476,5164,'1998-09-05 03:58:17','Tank Girl',12,6,8,3,225,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'This kit was an exclusive from the Film & TV Model Club in England and is no longer availiable.','',''),(4477,5242,'1999-07-10 01:29:00','Goddess in Alloy',10,6,19,6,5253,5242,'120.0000','8.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'A 1/4 scale art piece!  Available NOW as a resin kit ($120.00) or a pre-painted statue ($135.00)!<p>\nHer flesh is cold metal, but her heart and soul are that of a human.  Imagine that the ancient gods, in their cruel trickery, had made a woman, giving her all the thoughts and emotions and desires to which a mortal was entitled.  But imagine they placed these emotions into the body of an ornate metal doll: exquisite, shapely, but totally encapsulated in a skin like armor. <p> Would she serve her masters like a marionette, or use the potential of her hardened form to destroy them? <p>\nThe Goddess in Alloy is a huge piece, matching size with many popular 1/4 scale Japanese lady figures.  Includes circular biomechanical base and brass spear shaft.  All parts are well cast, with care taken to provide a good fit and a smooth, refined surface finish.  You won\'t be disappointed by this kit!<p>\nOriginal character design and sculpture copyright James Hakola 1998.<p>\n\nCome visit us at <a href=http://www.mrdandy.com>MrDandy.com</a>!','Fantasy,sci-fi,pinup,sexy,anime',''),(4478,5244,'1998-09-05 18:43:33','Secrets of Expert Mold Making & Resin Casting',27,11,106,10,5254,5254,'19.9500','3.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'A comprehensive guide to mold making and\nresin casting. Extensively illustrated, \nhighly detailed basic to advanced \ntechniques.','',''),(4479,5189,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','T-800 Endoskeleton',17,5,73,12,149,148,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4480,5240,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','QT Honey',11,6,10,6,149,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4481,5240,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Liz Spanking',11,6,6,6,149,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4482,5240,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Liz Spanking',11,6,6,6,149,47,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4483,5241,'1998-09-08 10:38:25','7th Voyage of Sinbad Dragon Restoration Collectors Bust',52,6,6,4,5241,5241,'150.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'A restoration of the original stop-motion\nprop endorsed by Ray Harryhausen and limited\nto a run of 500 pieces. Wood plaque and resin\nnameplate included. Copper hinged collar and brass \nengraved autographed nameplate sold seperately.','Endorsed by Ray Harryhausen and Lincensed through Columbia Pictures',''),(4484,5241,'1998-09-08 10:33:48','7th Voyage of Sinbad Dragon Restoration Collectors Bust',52,6,6,4,5241,5241,'150.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,'A restoration of the original stop-motion\nprop endorsed by Ray Harryhausen and limited\nto a run of 500 pieces. Wooden plaque and\nresin nameplate included. Copper hinged collar\nand brass engraved nameplate sold seperately.','Endorsed by Ray Harryhausen and Lincensed through Columbia Pictures',''),(4485,204,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Dracula (bat form)',12,10,0,7,1