e was created from one of\nthe original 3\" stop-motion saucers from the\nmovie. It was taken apart before molding and\neach piece was mold and cast seperately so when\nit is assembled the disks turn and spin just\nlike the real stop-motion prop. This our\nfirst tribute piece to Ray Harryhausen comes endorsed by\nRay and is licensed through Columbia Pictures.','',''),(4530,5241,'1998-09-22 14:44:06','Flesh Gordon\'s BEETLEMAN',52,6,7,4,5241,5241,'100.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,' This piece was created from original 1:1\nscale photo\'s taken in 1979 at the great stop-motion\nand special effects company C.P.C. Associates at which\ntime the original puppet was being restored and\nanimated for a simulator ride project entitled\n\"Space Ride\". The sculpting of this piece was painstakingly\nrecreated over a 2 year period of time by master\nsculptor Kevin Thomas under the supervision of Hal Miles.\nThe lincense for this piece is currently pending through Howard\nZiehm and is available for immediate shipping.','',''),(4531,5241,'1998-09-22 15:04:43','Mighty Joe Young STOP-MOTION ARMATURE SKULL REPRODUCTION 50th ANNIVERSERY COLLECTORS TRIBUTE',52,6,3,4,5241,5241,'75.0000','5.0000',0,NULL,NULL,' This animatable piece was re-machined and\nre-sculptd from an original 1:1 scale casting\nfrom one of the original Joe armature skulls. It comes\npre-assembled and mounted on a finished wood\nbase with a cast resin anniversery plaque and is available\nfor immediate shipping.','',''),(4532,5270,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Dracula Wolf Version',12,10,0,7,149,66,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4533,5277,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Birth Of A Legend',17,19,5,3,81,81,'140.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4534,5277,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','The Dark Knight Returns',12,6,5,3,149,149,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4535,5277,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Storm',15,5,15,3,5290,5290,'0.0000','0.0000',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',''),(4536,5277,'2001-01-03 11:22:02','Silver Surfer',17,5,17,3,52